onomy needed, fully verifiable."]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed","children":["· ","The 60-year cycle gives the year pillar; the 60-day cycle gives the day pillar. They run independently."]}]]}]]}]
