,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed","children":["· ","Honesty features: if a birth lands within ±1 minute of a boundary, the app says so — pillars may split across schools."]}],"$L1c","$L1d"]}]]}]
b:["$","section","7",{"className":"card p-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-400 font-mono","children":"07"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-amber-950","children":["十神"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"shí shén"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-stone-500","children":"ten gods — the day master's relations"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-stone-700 mt-2 leading-relaxed","children":"The 十神 are not deities. They are the ten ways another stem can RELATE to the day master: same phase (比劫), the day master generates (食伤), the day master restrains (财), restrains the day master (官), generates the day master (印). The 正/偏 split is pure polarity. They name relationships — nothing more."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 mt-3","children":[["$","div","比肩bǐ jiān",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["比肩"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"bǐ jiān"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"peer — same phase, same polarity"}]]}],["$","div","劫财jié cái",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["劫财"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"jié cái"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"rival — same phase, opposite polarity"}]]}],["$","div","食神shí shén",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["食神"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"shí shén"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"output — day master generates, same polarity"}]]}],["$","div","伤官shāng guān",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["伤官"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"shāng guān"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"talent — day master generates, opposite polarity"}]]}],["$","div","偏财piān cái",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["偏财"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"piān cái"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"wealth — day master restrains, same polarity"}]]}],["$","div","正财zhèng cái",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["正财"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"zhèng cái"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"wealth — day master restrains, opposite polarity"}]]}],["$","div","七杀qī shā",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["七杀"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"qī shā"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"pressure — restrains the day master, same polarity"}]]}],["$","div","正官zhèng guān",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","chil