c:["$","section","8",{"className":"card p-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-400 font-mono","children":"08"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-amber-950","children":["合冲刑害"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"hé chōng xíng hài"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-stone-500","children":"interactions — how branches talk to each other"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-stone-700 mt-2 leading-relaxed","children":"Branches relate in fixed geometries: 六合 (six harmony pairs), 三合 (three-branch groups), 半合 (adjacent legs), 冲 (opposition), 刑 (punishment — including the four 自刑 self-punishments), 害 (harm). A pair can carry more than one relation — 巳申 is both 六合 and 刑. These are STRUCTURAL facts, not fortunes."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 mt-3","children":[["$","div","六合liù hé",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["六合"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"liù hé"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"six harmony — 子丑, 寅亥, 卯戌, 辰酉, 巳申, 午未"}]]}],["$","div","三合sān hé",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["三合"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"sān hé"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"three harmony — 申子辰(水), 亥卯未(木), 寅午戌(火), 巳酉丑(金); a transit branch can complete a group"}]]}],["$","div","半合bàn hé",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["半合"," ",