d:["$","section","9",{"className":"card p-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-400 font-mono","children":"09"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-amber-950","children":["大运流年"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"dà yùn liú nián"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-stone-500","children":"decades and years — the moving layer"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-stone-700 mt-2 leading-relaxed","children":"The natal chart is fixed; 大运 (decade pillars) and 流年 (annual pillars) move over it. 起运 — when the decades start — is computed from the time between birth and the governing 节: 3 days counts as 1 year, 1 day as 4 months, one 时辰 as 10 days. Each decade steps one ganzhi from the month pillar; each year brings its own pillar to read against the chart."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 mt-3","children":[["$","div","起运qǐ yùn",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["起运"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"qǐ yùn"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"the start of the decade sequence, computed from the birth-to-节 interval"}]]}],["$","div","大运dà yùn",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["大运"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"dà yùn"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"decade pillar — ten years, stepping forward (顺行) or backward (逆行) by the chart's rule"}]]}],["$","div","流年liú nián",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["流年"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"liú nián"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"the year's pillar read against the natal branches"}]]}],["$","div","神煞shén shā",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["神煞"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"shén shā"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"named star-markers (禄, 羊刃, 驿马, 华盖, 桃花, 天乙贵人, 文昌 …) — tables for further study"}]]}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-3 space-y-1","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed","children":["· ","Direction rule: yang-year male and yin-year female step forward; the other two step backward."]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed","children":["· ","The moving layer describes climates and seasons — it never decides outcomes. Weather, not sentences."]}]]}]]}]
e:["$","section","10",{"className":"card p-4","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-baseline gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-400 font-mono","children":"10"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-xl font-bold text-amber-950","children":["the frame"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"善人不为命所缚"}]]}],["$","span",null,{"className":"text-sm text-stone-500","children":"the good are not bound by fate"}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-stone-700 mt-2 leading-relaxed","children":"Everything in the first nine modules is a language for reading a map. The map describes the God-given temperament: created good, distorted by the fall, and — the heart of this center — recreated in Christ. A chart cannot sentence anyone. The one who follows Christ is not bound by it."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2 mt-3","children":[["$","div","善人shàn rén",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["善人"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"shàn rén"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"the good person — the one walking with the Shepherd (Ps 23)"}]]}],["$","div","不为命所缚bù wéi mìng suǒ fù",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["不为命所缚"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"bù wéi mìng suǒ fù"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"is not bound by fate — the chart may describe, it never rules"}]]}],["$","div","重生chóng shēng",{"className":"border border-stone-200 rounded p-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-amber-900","children":["重生"," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 font-normal","children":"chóng shēng"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"text-xs text-stone-600 mt-0.5 leading-relaxed","children":"rebirth — 死 to self, new creation in Christ (Jn 3:3; 2 Cor 5:17)"}]]}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-3 space-y-1","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed","children":["· ","The rebirth slot in the app splits your 大运 timeline into two regimes: before it, the chart binds; after it, the chart describes but no longer rules."]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed","children":["· ","Tool informs, user decides. This center computes maps, never sentences — no health, death, or money verdicts, ever."]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed","children":["· ","The anti-idol clause: even a good thing becomes a snare when worshipped. 2 Kings 18:4 — Hezekiah broke the bronze serpent Moses had made, because the people had made it an idol. Charts are for reading; only Christ is for following."]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed","children":["· ","Read the map. Follow the Lion. (Rev 5:5)"]}]]}]]}]
