23:["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-3 space-y-1","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed","children":["· ","The transit timeline shows markers, not verdicts: a 冲 is a fact of geometry, and its meaning in a life is a reading — never computed."]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"text-xs text-stone-500 leading-relaxed","children":["· ","Some pairs carry several relations at once (巳申 = 六合 + 刑; 寅申 = 冲 + 刑). The app lists them all."]}]]}]
